# The whole local restore point, not just the tarballs. A host firewall
# baseline snapshotted in here was root-owned, and prove-gates-fail.sh copies
# the fixture tree in order to inject faults into it -- so three fault
# injectors had been failing outright since that snapshot was taken, and the
# harness reported 22 proven where it reports 26. Machine state does not belong
# in a source tree, and a scratch directory does not belong in git.
